                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Note.  Bought this game for local play on Media center in living room.. so on TV rather than monitor.\nMain issue with this game, is the scaling.. certain things are tiny, when not pressing your face up against the screen, which seems like a big miscalculation, for such a family friendly game.\nIf the scaling of stuff like the Point markers, the number of cats and actually the mouse cursor itself went up, it would be far more playable.\n",
